  "note": "Text-led cards (Phase 5 of the formats plan, 2026-11-11): a Google review, a statement or a timeline set by software on a plain colour. No photograph, no image call, no logo, no drawn button. Each pairing: the card's own colour (bg), its type (ink), the accent (stars, dots, the callout), the quiet type (muted), and the paper panel a review sits on (paper, paper_ink). Contrast is checked in code (render-cards.mjs): ink on bg and paper_ink on paper at 4.5:1 or more, accent on bg at 3:1 or more.",
